zit te vinden lijken daarbij van pas te komen. De plaats die als toevlucht dient blijkt echter eigen geheimen en misdadigers te hebben. Robbie raakt opnieuw in moeilijkheden die verder gaan dan gewone diefstal.","work_id":987135004,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Robbie de Hand9789022534847; Legends of Riftwar3, RaymondFeist metSteveStirling. Auteurssynopsis bevestigt Krondor/Arutha en vlucht naarLandsEnd. Beide auteurs onderscheiden, geen omnibus ofRobbie-storiesbundel.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p252124731"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#78","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-007.json","sources":["https://www.crydee.com/raymond-feist/book-synopsis/jimmy-the-hand","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p252124731","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL554703W"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[{"name":"S. M. Stirling","role":"coauthor","source":"https://www.crydee.com/raymond-feist/publication-information/netherlands/legends-of-the-riftwar"}],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did not yield an identity-approved asset. Preserve existing resolver and document its actual image or neutral placeholder in hosted acceptance; not proof of provider-wide absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789022534847","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15168051,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"0e5eaf5635f1c02234e225a0e3a9e680fc357d0b4dee55ac8eb2522a8c89ba78"},{"status":"indexed_bulk_source_unavailable","coverId":15168051,"receipt":"cover-tar-readback.json","receiptSha256":"bd239ad8743b1753337e7794d65733305c254d3b6faf80caab4c3b0dc1edbfb3"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T07:3