 theorie ontwikkelden en bespreekt verschijnselen rond atomen, straling en de betekenis van metingen. De vragen gaan niet alleen over berekeningen, maar ook over wat de theorie over de werkelijkheid zegt. Het boek is bedoeld als toegankelijke verkenning voor lezers zonder specialistische voorkennis en verbindt de geschiedenis van ontdekkingen met hun moeilijke interpretatie.","work_id":987135005,"evidence":[{"note":"ExactDutch9789025466015 vertaalt InSearchOfSchrodingersCat1984. John/JonathanRGribbin zijn gebonden via bronauthoriteit en exacte titel; geen fictieroman of automatische smaaktesttoelating.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p851796753"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#79","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-007.json","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p851796753","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL7918929W"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did not yield an identity-approved asset. Preserve existing resolver and document its actual image or neutral placeholder in hosted acceptance; not proof of provider-wide absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789025466015","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":7353505,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"0e5eaf5635f1c02234e225a0e3a9e680fc357d0b4dee55ac8eb2522a8c89ba78"},{"status":"indexed_bulk_source_unavailable","coverId":7353505,"receipt":"cover-tar-readback.json","receiptSha256":"bd239ad8743b1753337e7794d65733305c254d3b6faf80caab4c3b0dc1edbfb3"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.964Z","editionKey":"/books/OL25697332M","limitation":"No verified image is 