 toekomst vast te lopen. Ze besluit hem in de hel te zoeken, maar moet die tocht maken met Peter Murdoch, haar grootste rivaal. Hun onderlinge competitie verdwijnt niet zodra de gevaren groter worden. De reis confronteert hen met ambitie, afhankelijkheid en de vraag wat zij bereid zijn te doen om hun plaats in de wetenschap veilig te stellen.","work_id":987135010,"evidence":[{"note":"Katabasis9789044370119 Dutchpaperback, KBorigineelHarperVoyager2025 en RebeccaF/ RFKuang. FranseinhoudsbronbeschrijftzelfdeAliceLaw/PeterMurdoch/JacobGrimes; taalvandebronwordtnieteditietaal.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444689680"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#89","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-008.json","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p444689680","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL42397860W"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did not yield an identity-approved asset. Preserve existing resolver and document its actual image or neutral placeholder in hosted acceptance; not proof of provider-wide absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789044370119","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15119182,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"0e5eaf5635f1c02234e225a0e3a9e680fc357d0b4dee55ac8eb2522a8c89ba78"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.965Z","editionKey":"/books/OL60041650M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/