:null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Prometheus","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL25697271M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987135013,"language":"nl"},"seq":62,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Stephen Hawking en Roger Penrose bespreken fundamentele vragen over ruimte, tijd en het heelal. Beiden proberen inzichten uit de algemene relativiteitstheorie en de quantummechanica bij elkaar te brengen, maar hun benaderingen lopen uiteen. Het boek maakt die verschillen zichtbaar en laat zien hoe twee natuurkundigen vanuit gedeelde vraagstukken tot andere standpunten kunnen komen. De nadruk ligt op hun gedachtewisseling en op de moeilijkheid om een samenhangende beschrijving van de natuur te ontwikkelen.","work_id":987135013,"evidence":[{"note":"De aard van ruimte en tijd9789053334249, Hawking metRogerPenrose, Princeton1996. JohnHawkes is contaminatie in geclusterdeOLauteurs; nietals derde fysicus opnemen. Kosmologisch debat, geenfictie.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p147590159"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#96","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-008.json","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p147590159","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL1892619W"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[{"name":"Roger Penrose","role":"coauthor","source":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p147590159"}],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did not yield an identity-approved asset. Preserve existing resolver and document its actual image or neutral placeholder in hosted acceptance; not proof of provider-wide absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789053334249","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","att