r de patiënten anders naar hun dagelijkse leven gaan kijken. Achter de ongebruikelijke werkwijze schuilt bovendien een reden die niet meteen duidelijk is. Het boek vertelt over ontmoetingen tussen mensen en katten binnen deze fictieve praktijk.","work_id":987135014,"evidence":[{"note":"Een kat op recept9789029099912 bindt aanJapaneseNekoWoShohoItashimasu2023, PHPprimarypublisher8March2023. Niet2026mangaadaptatie/latere vervolgen. SyouIshidaJapaneseauthor, geen Engelseeditie door Engelsebrontekst.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p443106975"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#100","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-008.json","sources":["https://www.php.co.jp/books/detail.php?isbn=978-4-569-90288-3","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p443106975","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL37920099W"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did not yield an identity-approved asset. Preserve existing resolver and document its actual image or neutral placeholder in hosted acceptance; not proof of provider-wide absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789029099912","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15203527,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"0e5eaf5635f1c02234e225a0e3a9e680fc357d0b4dee55ac8eb2522a8c89ba78"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.966Z","editionKey":"/books/OL61471418M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p4431